{"speciesId":642,"names":{"fr":"Fulguris","es":"Thundurus","en":"Thundurus","ja":"ボルトロス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les terres qu’il a survolées sont recouvertes d’innombrables traces des éclairs qu’il y a fait tomber."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Countless charred remains mar the landscape of places through which Thundurus has passed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa queue lance des décharges électriques. Il vole dans le ciel d’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa queue lance des décharges électriques. Il vole dans le ciel d’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lanza descargas eléctricas por las púas de su cola. Sobrevuela Teselia dejando caer rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾の トゲから 電撃を 撃ち出す。イッシュ地方の 空を 飛び回り 雷を 落とす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vole dans le ciel d’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs, provoquant des incendies qui font sa mauvaise réputation."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su gusto por surcar el cielo lanzando rayos y provocando incendios forestales le ha granjeado pocas simpatías."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked."},{"language":